# Committed, dev-only. `.env.development.local` (gitignored) overrides anything here.
#
# Point dev builds at the local relay. If it isn't running, Elephant's startup health
# probe fails, it falls back to talking to Discogs directly, and shows a banner — so
# `yarn elephant start` works with or without it.
#
#   yarn elephant relay              # relay only
#   yarn elephant start-with-relay   # relay + dev server together
#
# Why local rather than a hosted relay: Discogs buckets rate limits per source IP even
# for authenticated requests, so a hosted relay shares one 60/min budget across all its
# users. Locally you get your own, and your token never leaves the machine.
REACT_APP_DISCOGS_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8787
